WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Ark Two and Three didn’t agree.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Everyone is waiting and watching

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,050
That's why I'm going to help these people

4
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:08,530
They opened a hundred thousand dollar box

5
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:09,530
One hundred thousand tons of grain

6
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,580
I can't see anyone sinking into the abyss of the ancient sea.

7
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:16,580
Even in times of crisis, I can help you in times of difficulty, and I won’t let you go.

8
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:33,180
These two companies are very calculating.

9
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:35,180
They wait for the other person to speak first

10
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,180
Or wait until Ark-1 reaches its limit

11
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:39,180
Then force out the greatest benefits

12
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:42,340
They can't wait for Ark-1 to be completely negative.

13
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,340
Just go up and eat the corpse.

14
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:46,340
Hold on to the ark until then
